        "original_id": "9cae39b3-d0f7-5465-914b-77ba7bf75cf0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brian Burton, James Mercer, John Power, Peter Wilkinson\n- Bands: Broken Bells, Cast, The Shins, The La's, Shack\n- Places: America, England, Liverpool\n- Roles: artist-producer, lead vocalist, guitarist, backing vocalist, bass guitarist\n\nFacts:\n- Broken Bells is an American indie rock band composed of Brian Burton, who is better known as Danger Mouse, and James Mercer.\n- James Mercer is the lead vocalist and guitarist for the indie rock band The Shins.\n- In 1992, Cast was formed in Liverpool, England, by John Power and Peter Wilkinson.\n- John Power had left The La's before forming Cast.\n- Peter Wilkinson's former band Shack had split before he formed Cast.\n- In Cast, John Power performed vocals and guitar, and Peter Wilkinson performed backing vocals and bass.",
